00:20:47,340 --> 00:20:49,200
We can carry that in several flavors.

251
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:50,800
The 2,000-pound is the most common.

252
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:54,360
We do have the 5,000-pound GPS-aided munitions.

253
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:57,240
We have a few of those left, and we're getting some more.

254
00:20:57,680 --> 00:21:02,040
And we can carry some standoff guided munitions, the joint standoff weapon, the JSAO.

255
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:07,640
By the 1990s, the top secret B-2 begins to enter service,

256
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:12,600
but it would take on a completely different role than planned as an answer to Soviet aggression.

257
00:21:14,220 --> 00:21:17,700
The Soviet Union finally crumbles in December 1991,

258
00:21:17,701 --> 00:21:22,860
and with the collapse of the Iron Curtain, the new B-2 has an uncertain future.

259
00:21:22,861 --> 00:21:33,540
originally 132 b2s were to have been built but congress wants cutbacks and with a b2 costing

