00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:38,080
and the amazing contributions that some very smart engineers made to make that plane possible.

270
00:22:38,520 --> 00:22:40,900
And just looking at it fly was pretty amazing.

271
00:22:40,901 --> 00:22:50,060
It's just an incredible marvel to see something of such an unorthodox shape.

272
00:22:50,061 --> 00:22:55,340
It's almost an eerie sense of awe that you get when you see that aircraft flying.

273
00:22:55,341 --> 00:23:02,140
I hear this kind of high-pitched whistling sound and I stop and I kind of drive closer

274
00:23:02,141 --> 00:23:07,340
to the flight line there and out of like the shadows around the corner of those docks I

