00:23:07,341 --> 00:23:08,460
I just see lights flashing.

276
00:23:09,620 --> 00:23:12,340
And I was like, what in the world is that?

277
00:23:12,380 --> 00:23:15,680
And it gets closer, and that was my first actual glimpse of a B-2.

