00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:32,960
And to be part of the B-2 program requires an elite caliber of pilot.

282
00:23:32,961 --> 00:23:41,240
We look for aviators who have proven that they are among the best aviators we have in our Air Force.

283
00:23:41,940 --> 00:23:46,940
And then we spend a lot of time training them to understand the stresses of long-duration flight,

284
00:23:47,420 --> 00:23:51,280
to be able, as a two-person crew, to operate in that tactical environment

