00:26:30,381 --> 00:26:33,260
before you move into actually what your job is

327
00:26:33,261 --> 00:26:36,500
so that you have a sound knowledge as a pilot about the plane first,

328
00:26:36,760 --> 00:26:38,320
and then you go and become a warrior.

329
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:39,440
It's pretty cool.

