00:27:22,161 --> 00:27:28,160
But sometimes pushing that resource in a simulator can also mean pushing yourself to the limit.

343
00:27:28,161 --> 00:27:34,460
We flew a simulator for 44.4 hours, and I believe at the time it was a U.S.

344
00:27:34,461 --> 00:27:36,980
record for a simulator flight.

