00:27:49,540 --> 00:27:51,100
and so it was excellent training for that.

349
00:27:52,360 --> 00:27:54,860
After spending months of practice in the simulator,

350
00:27:55,260 --> 00:27:58,360
the students will get their chance to actually fly a B-2.

351
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:01,560
But for many of these pilots,

