00:28:10,980 --> 00:28:14,426
By the mid-1990s, the first U.S.

354
00:28:14,427 --> 00:28:24,440
Air Force B-2 stealth bomber pilots have completed training and are ready for the real thing.

355
00:28:25,660 --> 00:28:29,120
After months spent in the simulator, they head out for their first flight.

356
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:32,480
That's amazing. It is amazing.

357
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:34,560
Sometimes you forget you're even in an airplane.

358
00:28:34,700 --> 00:28:39,220
You have to look out the wing and go, ah, this is actually, there's still an airplane here because there's no, you know,

